Required:
- Use ReGraph for interactive node/edge relationship visualization.
- Keep the graph data small and local for demo apps.
- Connect graph selection with related app state when the user asks for click/highlight/focus behavior.
- Keep the implementation simple.
- Follow `src/platform/regraph/README.md` for the exact ReGraph item model and sizing guidance.

Forbidden:
- Do not replace ReGraph with another graph/chart package.
- Do not install fallback visualization packages.
- Do not use ReGraph for normal tables or simple cards.
